WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:12.436
First Battalion Princess Patricia's Canadian Light Infantry Kit Shop sold tactical combat gear to a certified mentally challenged signals operator, made him carry the LAV Blank Firing Attachment, and then deployed him to Afghanistan.

00:00:12.386 --> 00:00:16.250
Dr. Selhi of Providence Care confirmed the diagnosis.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:24.659
The Canadian Forces took a vulnerable person, armed him, deployed him to a war zone, and when he complained — they turned the investigation against him.
